<template><div><h1 id="wiki_setup">Setup</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Gas valves, bunker power and Salt Mine</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-valves" data-guide-step>Follow the three pipes from the Village Square valve indicator. Hold each valve until its dial turns green at 60: behind Armour, left of the Bunker entrance and Riverside near the Pub. Releasing early drops its pressure.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0149.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0149.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve behind Village Square Armour&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve behind Village Square Armour&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0149&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0150.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0150.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve left of the Bunker entrance&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve left of the Bunker entrance&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0150&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0151.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0151.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Riverside valve near Pub&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Riverside valve near Pub&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0151&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-pilot" data-guide-step>Activate the Pilot Light in the square, clear the Pests, drop through its hole and climb the slope to the generator. Turn that generator on, then purchase access to the Bunker, Morgue and Laboratory.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0152.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0152.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Pilot Light hole&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Pilot Light hole&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0152&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0153.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0153.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Underground generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Underground generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0153&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-switches" data-guide-step>Activate the Laboratory upper-level switch and Morgue switch near STG-44 within roughly a minute of one another. If the pair expires, reactivate both. Open the Salt Mine once the power connection succeeds.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0155.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0155.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory power switch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory power switch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0155&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0156.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0156.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue power switch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue power switch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0156&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0157.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0157.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Salt Mine door&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Salt Mine door&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0157&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pap">Unlock Ubersprengen</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-pap-button" data-guide-step>Press the Sewers red button near the MP-40. Ride each of the three sewer-pipe routes: Tower’s back-left corner, Command Room near Grease Gun and Laboratory near the electrical trap. Each drops you into its own side room; press that room’s red button before leaving.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0158.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0158.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sewers activation button&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sewers activation button&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0158&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0160.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0160.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Tower pipe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tower pipe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0160&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0161.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0161.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Command Room pipe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Command Room pipe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0161&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0162.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0162.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory pipe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory pipe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0162&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0159.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0159.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Side-room cage button&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Side-room cage button&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0159&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-pap-upgrade" data-guide-step>After all three buttons, the cage rises around Ubersprengen. Upgrade an ordinary weapon for 5,000 Jolts; upgraded ammunition costs 4,000. The Tesla part forge in Command Room is a separate machine.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-tesla">Charge and escort the Tesla device</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-tesla-crank" data-guide-step>Turn the Command Room crank until it stops. In the Emperor’s Chamber, interact with the hilt device and kill zombies inside its floor circle until the Geistkraft device rises.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0163.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0163.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Command Room crank&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Command Room crank&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0163&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0164.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0164.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Initial hilt charging device&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Initial hilt charging device&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0164&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-tesla-lab" data-guide-step>Press the upper-platform button in Command Room. Follow the device into the Laboratory and, whenever it stops, kill zombies inside its red circle. Let it enter the generator near Schnellblitz, then collect the ejected Tesla part.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0165.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0165.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Command Room escort button&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Command Room escort button&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0165&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0166.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0166.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory Tesla generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory Tesla generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0166&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0167.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0167.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First Tesla part&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First Tesla part&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0167&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-tesla-morgue" data-guide-step>Follow the device into the Morgue and repeat its red-circle charge stops. Wait for the generator to release the second part. Returning to Command Room spawns a Brenner on the upper platform; kill it and keep its head for the later bird readings.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0168.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0168.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue Tesla part&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue Tesla part&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0168&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-tesla-build" data-guide-step>Fit both parts on the upper-platform forge and wait for assembly. Take the Tesla Gun. Each player can claim it from the forge; its electricity is needed for the quest interactions.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0169.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0169.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Tesla Gun assembly point&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tesla Gun assembly point&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0169&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-right-hand">Power grid and lightning rods</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-grid-read" data-guide-step>Activate the grid machine behind the Tesla forge. Read the four lit colours left to right and record them in the tool. Under the timed activation, set box 1 in Command Room, box 2 at the Sewers fire-trap side, box 3 at the Riverside end of Sewers and box 4 at the back of Pub by the Tower door. Rot = red, Grün = green, Blau = blue.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0221.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0221.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Power-grid activation machine&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Power-grid activation machine&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0221&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0222.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0222.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Read the lit colours left to right&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Read the lit colours left to right&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0222&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-rod-centre" data-guide-step>Pull the Tower’s central lever to start raising the lightning rod. Defend it until its health bar disappears. A damaged rod descends; wait for it to reset, then restart its lever.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0227.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0227.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Central Tower rod lever&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Central Tower rod lever&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0227&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-rod-outer" data-guide-step>Activate and defend the two outer Tower levers. When all three rods are raised, interact with the Right Hand of God in the Emperor’s Chamber; it is the hand on your left when facing the statue.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0228.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0228.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Two outer Tower levers&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Two outer Tower levers&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0228&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0229.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0229.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Right Hand of God&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Right Hand of God&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0229&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-final-reich-grid" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-left-hand">Deliver three Zeppelin batteries</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-zeppelin-drop" data-guide-step>Outside, wait for the Zeppelin’s electrical attack to expose yellow lights underneath it. Shoot a lit generator until it turns red and falls; follow its landing position.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0230.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0230.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Vulnerable underside lights&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Vulnerable underside lights&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0230&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0231.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0231.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Fallen generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Fallen generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0231&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-zeppelin-charge" data-guide-step>Kill zombies close to the fallen generator until it explodes and leaves a battery. Carry it to the Left Hand of God in the Emperor’s Chamber, on your right when facing the statue. Drop and retrieve the battery if you need to fight.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0232.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0232.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Left Hand battery placement&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Left Hand battery placement&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0232&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-zeppelin-three" data-guide-step>Repeat for three delivered batteries. On the third attempt the Zeppelin recalls a dropped generator; shoot another one down rather than waiting at the empty landing point. After delivering all three, interact with the Left Hand.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-voice-of-god">Match painting numerals to the bird dials</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-voice-read" data-guide-step>Aim the Brenner head’s purple light at the four paintings: upstairs Pub, Courtyard S-Mine area, Sewers by Riverside door and Morgue spike-trap room. Each shows a bird and Roman numeral. Record the numeral against that bird’s matching machine symbol, rather than the order in which you visited paintings.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0233.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0233.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Pub painting&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Pub painting&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0233&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0234.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0234.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Courtyard painting&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Courtyard painting&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0234&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0235.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0235.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sewers painting&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sewers painting&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0235&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0236.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0236.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue painting&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue painting&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0236&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-voice-input" data-guide-step>At the Emperor’s Chamber machine, identify the bird above each dial and enter its painting numeral. Press the large red button after all four are correct. The resulting sound and exposed energy around the hilt show that the first voice step registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0237.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0237.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Voice of God bird dials&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Voice of God bird dials&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0237&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-final-reich-voice" /></section>
<h1 id="wiki_hardcore_requirements">Hardcore Requirements</h1><section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-bloodthirst">Hardcore: Bloodthirst / red Tesla</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-blood-lamps" data-guide-step>Tesla-shoot the Riverside streetlamp near M1928 to create a spark. Switch to a bullet weapon and quickly shoot each newly sparking lamp as the spark travels through Riverside, Village and Command Room to Morgue. Follow the pictured route 1–27 in order and collect the battery by the spike trap. A timeout needs a new round before restarting at the first lamp.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0170.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0170.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 1: Riverside near M1928&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 1: Riverside near M1928&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0170&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0172.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0172.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 2: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 2: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0172&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0173.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0173.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 3: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 3: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0173&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0174.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0174.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 4: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 4: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0174&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0175.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0175.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 5: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 5: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0175&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0176.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0176.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 6: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 6: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_