https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0190&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0191.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0191.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 21: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 21: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0191&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0192.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0192.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 22: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 22: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0192&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0193.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0193.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 23: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 23: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0193&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0194.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0194.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 24: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 24: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0194&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0195.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0195.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 25: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 25: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0195&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0196.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0196.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 26: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 26: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0196&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0197.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0197.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lamp 27: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lamp 27: Bloodthirst spark route in order&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0197&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0171.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0171.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Battery drops by Morgue spike trap&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Battery drops by Morgue spike trap&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0171&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-blood-charge" data-guide-step>Fit the battery beside the Morgue spike trap. Charge it three times by killing groups of about five Pests in a single trap use. Partial groups between uses do not accumulate; watch the battery’s electrical flash. Gather Pests before activating each trap cycle.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0198.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0198.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bloodthirst battery charging station&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bloodthirst battery charging station&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0198&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-blood-machine" data-guide-step>After the lightning rods are defended and Zeppelin appears, place the charged battery in the Morgue Tesla generator’s left slot. Interact again and defend its health bar. Take the new part and claim Bloodthirst at the Command Room forge.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0200.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0200.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue left battery slot&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue left battery slot&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0200&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0201.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0201.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bloodthirst forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bloodthirst forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0201&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-reaper">Hardcore: Reaper / orange Tesla</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-reaper-battery" data-guide-step>Lure a Wustling to charge into the Sewers metal door left of the Pilot Light trap exit. Take the revealed battery and fit it in the nearby charger.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0202.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0202.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sewers battery door&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sewers battery door&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0202&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0203.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0203.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Reaper battery charger&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Reaper battery charger&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0203&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-reaper-charge" data-guide-step>Charge it twice, each time killing two Bombers together in one nearby saw-trap use. One Bomber followed by a later activation does not count as a pair. Shooting the small rear carrier head removes a Bomber’s bomb and helps keep the pair alive until positioned.</li>
<li id="guide-step-reaper-machine" data-guide-step>After the lightning-rod stage, place the charged battery in the Morgue Tesla generator’s right slot. Start and defend the transfer, collect the part and take Reaper at the forge.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0204.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0204.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue right battery slot&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue right battery slot&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0204&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0205.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0205.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Reaper forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Reaper forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0205&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-hurricane">Hardcore: Hurricane / purple Tesla</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-hurricane-battery" data-guide-step>Make a Bomber explode beside the metal door halfway up the Laboratory stairs left of Schildblitz. Take the battery and fit it inside the electrical trap’s charging station.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0206.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0206.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory staircase&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory staircase&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0206&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0207.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0207.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bomber-opened battery door&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Bomber-opened battery door&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0207&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0208.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0208.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hurricane trap charger&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Hurricane trap charger&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0208&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-hurricane-charge" data-guide-step>Charge it twice with two Wustlings killed together in one electrical-trap use each time. Preserve the Wustlings between rounds until two are positioned inside the trap area; a single kill in a cycle does not fill a pair.</li>
<li id="guide-step-hurricane-machine" data-guide-step>After defending the lightning rods, place the charged battery in the Laboratory Tesla generator’s right slot. Defend the transfer, collect the part and claim Hurricane at the forge.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0210.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0210.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory right battery slot&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory right battery slot&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0210&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0211.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0211.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hurricane forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Hurricane forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0211&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-midnight">Hardcore: Midnight / green Tesla</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-midnight-battery" data-guide-step>Aim a Brenner head at the Courtyard statue left of Lee Enfield to destroy it and reveal the battery. Tesla-shoot the battery off its perch and fit it in the charger to the statue’s right.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0212.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0212.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Courtyard hidden-battery statue&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Courtyard hidden-battery statue&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0212&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0213.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0213.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Midnight charger&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Midnight charger&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0213&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-midnight-charge" data-guide-step>Gather roughly ten ordinary zombies in the S-Mine trap area, then kill the group in one trap activation. The charged battery flashes and stops accepting energy; incomplete groups need another properly gathered attempt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-midnight-machine" data-guide-step>After the lightning rods, take the battery to the Laboratory generator’s left slot. Start and defend the transfer, collect the part and claim Midnight at the forge.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0214.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0214.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory left battery slot&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory left battery slot&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0214&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0215.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0215.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Midnight forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Midnight forge pedestal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0215&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-red-talon">Hardcore: Red Talon fingerprint safes</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-talon-coils" data-guide-step>After defending lightning rods, reactivate the Morgue and Laboratory power switches. Activate the extra switch right of the Salt Mine door in Command Room. Bring a Brenner head, then Tesla-shoot the exposed coils to darken the lights.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0216.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0216.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Extra Command Room switch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Extra Command Room switch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0216&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0217.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0217.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Exposed coils&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Exposed coils&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0217&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-talon-safes" data-guide-step>During darkness, scan the hidden safe just left inside Laboratory using the Brenner head. Rotate each dial until its fingerprint is showing and take the coin half. Do the same with the safe just left inside Morgue. Ignore red numbers on the safes. If darkness ends, repeat the coil step next round; collected halves remain.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0218.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0218.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Laboratory fingerprint safe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Laboratory fingerprint safe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0218&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0219.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0219.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue fingerprint safe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue fingerprint safe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0219&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-talon-claim" data-guide-step>Fit both coin halves in the wall opening at the base of Barbarossa’s statue in the Emperor’s Chamber and claim Red Talon.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0220.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0220.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red Talon pickup opening&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red Talon pickup opening&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0220&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-keepsakes">Hardcore: keepsakes, record and water wheel</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-keepsake-collect" data-guide-step>Shoot and collect one red, one yellow and one green keepsake from the exterior weather-vane locations. Red candidates are the Pub’s rear/front walls and its roof; yellow candidates are Pub-to-spawn wall, roof above Quick Revive, roof above Type 100 and Riverside gas valve; green candidates are the toyshop window, Tower above SVT-40 and Courtyard roof. Collect the fallen item after each shot.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0239.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0239.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-back keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-back keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0239&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0240.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0240.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-front keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-front keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0240&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0241.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0241.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-roof keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red Pub-roof keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0241&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0242.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0242.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow Pub keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow Pub keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0242&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0243.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0243.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow above Quick Revive&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow above Quick Revive&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0243&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0244.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0244.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow above Type 100&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow above Type 100&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0244&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0245.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0245.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow Riverside valve keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow Riverside valve keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0245&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0246.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0246.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Green toyshop keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Green toyshop keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0246&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0247.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0247.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Green Tower keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Green Tower keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0247&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0248.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0248.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Green Courtyard keepsake&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Green Courtyard keepsake&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0248&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-keepsake-codes" data-guide-step>Read yellow and red numbers from their coloured-bow machines. Yellow can be at the spawn window, couch beside the Armour-side valve or Riverside M1928 building window. Red can be upstairs toyshop window, Type 100 window or Command Room Grease Gun window. To obtain green, activate Pilot Trap, jump in and hold interact on the wall as it launches you toward the toyshop; its machine drops beside the trap control. Alternatively try green’s remaining clock positions after correctly setting the observed two.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0249.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0249.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine at spawn window&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine at spawn window&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0249&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0250.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0250.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine on couch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine on couch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0250&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0251.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0251.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine in Riverside&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow machine in Riverside&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0251&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0252.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0252.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red machine in toyshop&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red machine in toyshop&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0252&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0253.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0253.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red machine by Type 100&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red machine by Type 100&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0253&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0254.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0254.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red machine in Command Room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red machine in Command Room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0254&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0255.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0255.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Clock-position keepsake wall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Clock-position keepsake wall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0255&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-keepsake-record" data-guide-step>Fit keepsakes on the wall left of the Bunker door and rotate them to their observed clock numbers, with top as 0/12. Correct settings lock and open the drawer; retrieve the record. If the last keepsake keeps rotating through every position, recheck the other two numbers.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0256.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0256.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Record drawer&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Record drawer&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0256&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-keepsake-wheel" data-guide-step>Interact with the Riverside weather vane and follow its final pointing direction to the tiny yellow button. Shoot that button, wait for the river water wheel to stop and Tesla-shoot its newly exposed coils.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0257.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0257.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Weather vane activation&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Weather vane activation&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0257&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0259.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0259.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 1&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 1&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0259&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0261.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0261.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 2&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 2&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0261&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0263.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0263.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 3&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Yellow button candidate 3&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0263&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0265.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0265.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Water-wheel coils&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Water-wheel coils&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0265&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-second-voices">Hardcore: charge the record and read green flashes</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-record-charge" data-guide-step>Place the record on the upstairs Pub gramophone. With Red Talon, kill about 25–30 zombies during a single complete play of the song. Begin after its restart/static cue; if it finishes before charged, that play’s kills reset. The gramophone stops accepting energy and clicks when ready.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0266.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0266.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Pub gramophone&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Pub gramophone&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0266&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-record-flashes" data-guide-step>Count the four groups of green flashes, separated by pauses; the red flash marks the repeating sequence. In the tool choose Gramophone and store the four counts separately from painting numerals. Enter them at the Voice of God machine following the numbered bird order in the illustration. Listen for the louder-sound character response.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0267.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0267.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gramophone green-flash light&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gramophone green-flash light&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0267&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0268.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0268.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second-voice bird input order 1–4&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second-voice bird input order 1–4&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1218,&quot;height&quot;:333,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0268&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-final-reich-voice" /></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-rabenherz">Hardcore: claim the gem before the hilt</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-gem-chandelier" data-guide-step>Confirm all four Tesla upgrades, Red Talon and the completed second voice response. Shoot the chandelier over the hilt once with each upgraded Tesla variant. A shock travels to the hilt after each registered shot; the fourth grants the Rabenherz.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0269.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0269.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Chandelier above the hilt&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Chandelier above the hilt&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0269&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="casual" v-show='[&quot;casual&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-casual-hilt">Casual: enter the boss arena</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-casual-hilt-take" data-guide-step>Prepare armour, perks and upgraded weapons. Tesla-shoot the hilt’s surrounding energy orb, then interact with the hilt. This commits the squad to the Panzermörder arena; taking it now follows the Casual ending.<p class="guide-callout">Point of no return: hilt interaction starts the boss.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0238.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0238.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Energy orb around the hilt&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Energy orb around the hilt&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0238&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-hardcore-hilt">Hardcore: enter after all extra requirements</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-hardcore-hilt-take" data-guide-step>After claiming Rabenherz, prepare the squad. Tesla-shoot the energy orb around the hilt, then take the hilt to enter the hardcore Panzermörder fight. Its stun windows are shorter than the Casual fight.<p class="guide-callout">Point of no return: complete every Hardcore requirement before taking the hilt.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0238.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0238.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Final hilt orb&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Final hilt orb&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0238&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_boss_fight">Boss Fight</h1><section><h2 id="details-panzermorder">Panzermörder: attach three charged batteries</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-boss-battery" data-guide-step>Keep moving around the modified Village and avoid the boss’s charging swings. Shoot the Zeppelin’s currently lit underside generator down, then charge it with nearby zombie kills. Keep track of where its battery drops.</li>
<li id="guide-step-boss-attach" data-guide-step>Lure Panzermörder close to the charged battery and shoot it until it kneels. Pick up the battery and interact on the stunned boss to attach it. Coordinate the stun and carrier in co-op; Hardcore permits a shorter attach window.</li>
<li id="guide-step-boss-repeat" data-guide-step>After an attachment the boss leaves and zombies spawn. Survive until it returns, then repeat the generator, charging and attachment loop until three batteries are attached. The third completes the boss fight.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_ending">Ending</h1><section data-guide-branches="hardcore" v-show='[&quot;hardcore&quot;].includes(guideBranch)'><h2 id="details-escort-klaus">Hardcore ending: follow Klaus</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-klaus-follow" data-guide-step>After the boss, stay near the revived Klaus as he walks to the Village Square Pilot Trap. Proximity provides infinite ammunition; this is a follow sequence, not a fragile escort-health defence. Remain until his final dialogue and explosion to finish the ending.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-classic">Optional: add The Classic PPSh to the box</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-classic-bowls" data-guide-step>Drop Jolts into each of four bowls: right of the Morgue Tesla machine, burned ground left of Village Square SVT-40, Riverside sandbags in front of the M1928 building and upstairs Pub right of Kugelblitz. A money response follows each. After all four, The Classic joins the Mystery Box pool; this does not guarantee the next box roll.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-straub">Optional: spot Dr. Straub</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-straub-shoot" data-guide-step>After opening a route to Command Room/Morgue/Courtyard, watch the remote spawn windows for the man in a lab coat and shoot him for Lurking Around. Search Riverside windows, Laboratory hanging-body windows and Morgue barred/spawn areas. Looking directly at him makes him leave, and he stops appearing after the boss starts.<p><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide#dr-straub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Straub location photographs and character challenge reference ↗</a></p></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-challenge-notes">Optional challenges: keep restrictions separate</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-challenge-route" data-guide-step>Check Soldier → Dossier → Challenges before selecting a restricted run. No-perk, no-upgrade, no-down and timed Klaus/Panzermörder challenges have different conditions. A Casual boss clear is not a Hardcore Klaus rescue. Prologue survival tasks use the Prologue edition, not this map’s ordinary survival match.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_final_reich/the_final_reich_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CODZombies/wiki/the-final-reich/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">r/CODZombies community guide (2) ↗</a></li></ul><p>Select any reference image to enlarge it. Screenshot and symbol sources are credited in the linked walkthroughs; this guide uses local copies for reliable access.</p></section></div></template>
